WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.199
Wake up Link...

00:00:08.039 --> 00:00:10.598
The Great Calamity was merciless...

00:00:10.598 --> 00:00:14.464
It devastated everything in its path, lo,

00:00:14.464 --> 00:00:15.897
a century ago.

00:00:18.043 --> 00:00:19.930
However...

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.663
The princess survived.

00:00:23.462 --> 00:00:25.562
You must save her,

00:00:25.582 --> 00:00:26.895
my daughter!

00:00:28.181 --> 00:00:29.595
Open your eyes...

00:00:34.745 --> 00:00:35.827
Link...

00:00:37.607 --> 00:00:39.193
You are the light...

00:00:39.856 --> 00:00:41.059
Our light...

00:00:43.493 --> 00:00:46.225
That must shine upon Hyrule once again.

00:00:50.459 --> 00:00:51.657
Now go.

00:01:05.841 --> 00:01:09.053
I trust that you understand your duty.

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:11.453
Protect her...

00:01:12.089 --> 00:01:13.219
my daughter!

